# DeliFar 2.0 uses free, zero-API-key mapping (MapLibre + OpenFreeMap + Android Geocoder).
# No paid Google Maps API key is required.
#
# Optional: For high-volume commercial fleets, configure your own self-hosted
# OSM geocoding (Nominatim/Pelias) or routing (OSRM/Valhalla) server URLs in
# the in-app Settings screen under "Map & Geocoding Services".
#
# For Firebase cloud sync, place your Firebase Android config at:
#   app/google-services.json (ignored by git)
